 ganodorf  dragmire to life for the first time who  is the main villain that we follow  throughout the game ganondorf is  undoubtedly one of the coolest parts of  ocarina of time and again since the  developers at nintendo knew they needed  to design a character that was both  intriguing but also intimidating for  their growing teenage audience they  needed to think big literally and just  like link was designed based off of an  actor ganondorf was also designed based  off of another american actor known as  christopher lambert from highlander now  lambert might not be that big standing  at 5 foot 10 but he does have some  pretty big facial features which  reappeared on ganondorf's facial design  to start with the man has a hell of a  forehead which is the most obvious  detail that ganondorf also shares  although he normally covers that up with  a gerudo gemstone the lower stern brow  and sharp nose also made it over to  ganondorf's face and as such has  resulted in one of the most recognizable  and intimidating villains in video game  history and since ocarina of time the  zelda trio have gone through several  other redesigns but in each case it's  entirely related to the style of that  particular zelda game a super cartoony  bobble head and wind waker super darkly  edgy and twilight princess small town  storybook vibes and skyward sword and  finally a brand new blend of all of them  in breath of the wild as far as their  origins though you may now consider  yourself a bonafide expert unless you  already knew all of this either way  though let me know what you thought  about this video and if you learned  something new in the comments below and  also let me know if you'd like me to  cover any other topic of any other game  under the sun thank you so much for  watching and thank you in advance for  liking the video if you haven't already  and for subscribing if you haven't  already you totally should though huge  thanks as always to my bandit crew of  which i have t